This folder is a fork of Shepherdr 2.0.0 at commit ebb17d5 (https://github.com/eliasstravik/herdr-projects), used
under the MIT license. Its MIT notice (Elias Stravik) is kept unchanged below and in server/LICENSE; Lineclear's own
license is the LICENSE at the repo root.

The fork began with only names changed: environment variables start with LINECLEAR_ and the data folder is
~/.lineclear. Each en or em dash in its files became a plain mark. Since then Lineclear has changed the server
itself, in this repo's history (`git log -- server`).

